@@ -0,0 +1,315 @@
+//
+// Copyright (c) 2025-2026 rustmailer.com (https://rustmailer.com)
+//
+// This file is part of the Bichon Email Archiving Project
+//
+// This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
